"><b>Disclaimer:</b><sup>~</sup>Individual death claim settlement ratio FY-2025-26 | <sup>^^^</sup>Solvency ratio 266% as at 31 March 2026 against IRDAI mandated 150% | <sup>##</sup>Individual and group, as on 30th September, 2026 | <sup>***</sup>Asset under management (AUM) ₹1.46 lakh crore as on 30th September, 2026 | <sup>$$</sup>For details refer to press release published by <a href="https://www.careratings.com/upload/CompanyFiles/PR/202604120423_Bajaj_Life_Insurance_Limited.pdf" rel="nofollow">CARE</a> | <sup>*</sup>All figures are from FY 2006-07 to  June  2026.</div>
